# Big Data Analytics Options on AWS AWS Whitepaper

> This whitepaper helps architects, data scientists, and developers understand the big data analytics options available in the AWS cloud by providing an overview of services.

- [Abstract](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/big-data-analytics-options/welcome.md)
